WEBVTT

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:09.442
In America
and at NASA, we never cease to explore.

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:12.679
And a harvest is just as important

00:00:12.729 --> 00:00:15.965
now as it was in the first Thanksgiving.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:20.236
We need plants to survive
as we set up our moon base,

00:00:20.236 --> 00:00:23.673
and as we go to Mars, we're going to have
to grow our own nutrition.

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:26.326
So that's what we're doing this
Thanksgiving.

